
File Name: reset_password_screen.dart

1. Modification Done:

   * Created the Reset password page at `/auth/reset-password`.
   * Form accepts reset token and new password (minimum 8 characters).
   * Supports token passed in URL query `?token=` for email/dev links.

2. Purpose of This Modification:

   * Completes the forgot-password journey so members can set a new password and sign in again.

3. How This Modification Is Involved in the Flow:

   * Registered in `app_router.dart` under `/auth/reset-password`.
   * Calls `auth_service.resetPassword`; success offers link back to `/auth` sign-in.
